<title>UK: First Austrian Bank sets 400 mln Danish crown bond.</title>
<headline>First Austrian Bank sets 400 mln Danish crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FIRST AUSTRIAN BANK</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     *5.0	MATURITY    01.APR.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE    01.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEARS ONE TO FOUR, 7.25 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
